play-services-basement 18.11.0-safe

This directory redistributes a modified build of Google's
com.google.android.gms:play-services-basement:18.11.0.

Upstream license: Apache License 2.0.
The AAR includes Google's third_party_licenses.txt.

Change from upstream: the helpers that call
StrictMode.VmPolicy.Builder.permitUnsafeIntentLaunch() now invoke that method
by reflection and keep the original builder if the method is missing. Stock
18.11.0 crashes with NoSuchMethodError on incomplete ROMs that report API 31
but do not implement the method. The replacement sources are in
CoinCurrently/app/gms-patches/src.
